141→
142→SCORING CONTRACT:
143→- Scores must follow rubric anchors: 0=absent, 25=weak, 50=moderate, 75=strong, 100=perfect with evidence.
144→- Evidence REQUIRED for scores >= 75. Cite specific resume content.
145→- Be honest and precise. Avoid clustering around 50.
146→
147→CRITICAL MUST-HAVES (missing ANY = hard_fit false): ${criticalMustHaves || "None specified"}
148→PREFERRED MUST-HAVES (missing = penalty only): ${preferredMustHaves || "None specified"}
149→
